---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { LEGAL } from "../data/legal";

const description =
  "Terms and conditions for stud services, lock-in reservations, payments, shipping, and the pregnancy guarantee offered by The Boss Frenchies LV.";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description={description}
  path="/terms-and-conditions"
>
  <p>
    These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern the purchase and use of services and
    reservations offered by <strong>{LEGAL.businessName}</strong> ("we", "us", "our")
    through this website. By placing an order, paying a deposit, or booking a service,
    you ("customer", "you") agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not
    place an order.
  </p>

  <h2>1. About us</h2>
  <p>
    {LEGAL.businessName} is a French Bulldog kennel based in {LEGAL.location}. We offer
    stud services and lock-in reservations. You can contact us at
    <a href={LEGAL.phoneHref}>{LEGAL.phone}</a> or by
    <a href={LEGAL.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Services</h2>
  <p>We currently offer two products through our checkout:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Stud service ("Pay now"):</strong> a breeding with our stud, subject to
      availability and the conditions in these Terms.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Lock-in reservation ("Book"):</strong> a deposit that reserves a breeding
      and locks in the advertised price, subject to the conditions in these Terms.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The product, quantity, unit price, and total are shown at checkout before you submit
    your order. The quantity you select may not exceed the limit shown on the page.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Eligibility</h2>
  <p>
    You must be at least 18 years old and legally able to enter into a contract. By
    placing an order, you confirm that you own the bitch or are authorized by its owner
    to arrange the breeding.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Pricing, deposits, and payments</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>All prices are in U.S. dollars (USD).</li>
    <li>
      The lock-in reservation is <strong>$500 per unit</strong> and is a deposit toward
      the stud service. The full stud service is <strong>$2,500 per unit</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Shipping and transport are <strong>not included</strong> in any price. See Section
      5 below.
    </li>
    <li>
      The total shown at checkout is the amount due for the selected product and
      quantity, before shipping and any third-party costs.
    </li>
    <li>
      Payment must be made using one of the methods listed on our
      <a href="/payment-methods">Payment Methods</a> page. Please include your order
      reference in the memo or note.
    </li>
    <li>
      Your order is confirmed only after the payment has cleared and we have confirmed
      availability. Sending a checkout form does not, by itself, reserve a date or a
      breeding.
    </li>
    <li>
      We do not process card payments directly on this website. Payments made through
      Zelle, Cash App, Apple Pay, PayPal, Venmo, or another provider are subject to that
      provider's terms.
    </li>
    <li>
      Prices may change. The price you lock in is the price shown when your payment is
      accepted, subject to the lock-in terms in Section 9.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Shipping and transport are not included</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Shipping is not included in the price of any product or service.</strong>
    Shipping, transport, crates, health certificates, permits, and transport insurance
    are quoted separately based on your destination and the method you choose, and are
    paid by you.
  </p>
  <p>
    Pickup in Las Vegas may be available by appointment. Risk and responsibility for the
    dog pass to you when the dog is picked up or handed to the transport provider. Dates
    provided for delivery or transport are estimates and may change due to weather,
    airline schedules, veterinary requirements, or other circumstances outside our
    control.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Booking and estimated dates</h2>
  <p>
    The estimated required date you select at checkout is a request, not a confirmed
    appointment. We will contact you to confirm the date based on the bitch's cycle,
    progesterone testing, and availability. We may reschedule for health, safety, or
    operational reasons.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please notify us as soon as possible if you need to change a confirmed date. Changes
    requested less than 48 hours before the appointment may be treated as a late
    cancellation under Section 10.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Customer responsibilities</h2>
  <p>You are responsible for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Providing accurate contact, shipping, and order information.</li>
    <li>
      Ensuring the bitch is healthy, vaccinated, and tested negative for brucellosis
      within 30 days before the breeding, and is at least 18 months old.
    </li>
    <li>
      Providing progesterone test results or other veterinary information we request to
      time the breeding properly.
    </li>
    <li>Transporting and handling the bitch safely and humanely.</li>
    <li>
      Using the service only for lawful purposes and in compliance with applicable animal
      welfare, breeding, and transport laws.
    </li>
    <li>
      Paying all veterinary, shipping, transport, and third-party costs, unless we agree
      otherwise in writing.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Pregnancy guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    We guarantee that a breeding with our stud will result in a confirmed pregnancy in
    your bitch, subject to the conditions in this section. The guarantee applies to the
    breeding you purchased, whether natural or insemination, and is subject to the
    remedies below.
  </p>

  <h3>8.1 Conditions required to validate the guarantee</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Video proof of the insemination.</strong> You must record a continuous,
      unedited video of the complete insemination procedure. The video must show both
      dogs, the date and time, and the procedure from start to finish. Send us the
      original video file within 7 days after the procedure. Photos, clips, or edited
      videos are not sufficient.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Proper timing.</strong> The breeding must take place within the fertile
      window confirmed by progesterone testing or another method we approve in writing.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Veterinary confirmation.</strong> Pregnancy must be confirmed by a licensed
      veterinarian using ultrasound (or another method we approve) between 25 and 35 days
      after the breeding.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Notice.</strong> If no pregnancy is confirmed, you must notify us in
      writing within 7 days after the veterinary examination and no later than 45 days
      after the breeding, and provide the veterinary report.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Payment and health.</strong> The service must be fully paid, and the bitch
      must meet the health requirements in Section 7 at the time of breeding and
      confirmation.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h3>8.2 Remedy</h3>
  <p>
    If all conditions are met and no pregnancy is confirmed, we will provide
    <strong>one repeat breeding with the same stud at no additional stud fee</strong>,
    subject to availability and to the same conditions, within 12 months after the
    original breeding. If the repeat breeding also does not result in a confirmed
    pregnancy under the same conditions, we will refund the stud service fee paid for the
    original breeding, excluding shipping, transport, veterinary, travel, and other
    third-party costs.
  </p>
  <p>
    This remedy is the exclusive remedy for a failed pregnancy. It does not cover lost
    profits, litter expectations, or costs incurred with third parties.
  </p>

  <h3>8.3 Exclusions</h3>
  <p>The guarantee does not apply if:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You do not provide the required video proof or veterinary confirmation.</li>
    <li>The breeding was not performed within the approved fertile window.</li>
    <li>
      The bitch had a pre-existing condition, infection (including brucellosis),
      pyometra, abortion, or other health issue that prevented pregnancy.
    </li>
    <li>The bitch was bred with another stud during the same cycle.</li>
    <li>You failed to follow reasonable veterinary or handling instructions.</li>
    <li>The claim is made after the notice periods in Section 8.1.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>9. Lock-in reservations</h2>
  <p>
    A lock-in reservation is <strong>$500 per unit</strong>. The deposit is applied to
    the stud service fee and locks in the advertised price of $2,500 per unit for 12
    months from the date of payment, unless we agree otherwise in writing.
  </p>
  <p>
    Lock-in deposits are non-refundable, except where required by law or if we cancel the
    reservation and cannot offer a reasonable alternative. A lock-in is valid for one
    breeding and is not transferable to another person without our written consent. If
    the price changes after your lock-in expires, the new price applies.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Cancellations, rescheduling, and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    If you cancel a confirmed appointment less than 48 hours before the scheduled time,
    or if you do not attend, the payment or deposit may be retained to cover the reserved
    time and costs. Rescheduling is subject to availability.
  </p>
  <p>
    If we cancel and cannot offer a reasonable alternative date, we will refund the
    amount paid for the cancelled service. Shipping, transport, veterinary, and
    third-party costs are not refundable by us. Refunds are issued using the same payment
    method when possible.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Health and veterinary disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    Our stud is healthy to the best of our knowledge, and health records are available on
    request. We do not guarantee litter size, color, markings, conformation, gender, or
    any specific outcome beyond the pregnancy guarantee in Section 8. You are responsible
    for the health and veterinary care of your bitch and for any costs related to her
    pregnancy, whelping, and puppies.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental,
    special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for lost profits, lost opportunities,
    or expectations about a litter. Our total liability for any claim arising from a
    service will not exceed the amount you paid us for that service. Nothing in these
    Terms limits rights that cannot be waived under applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Indemnification</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from claims, damages, and costs arising
    from your breach of these Terms, your misuse of the service, inaccurate information
    you provide, the condition or behavior of your bitch, or your violation of any law or
    third-party right.
  </p>

  <h2>14. Privacy and data consent</h2>
  <p>
    By submitting the checkout form, you consent to the collection and processing of your
    personal information as described in our
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, including the use of your name, email,
    phone number, shipping address, order details, and the video and veterinary records
    required to validate the pregnancy guarantee.
  </p>
  <p>
    Marketing communications are optional and require a separate opt-in at checkout. You
    can withdraw marketing consent at any time by contacting us.
  </p>

  <h2>15. Media and communications</h2>
  <p>
    We may photograph or record our dogs and breeding activities for health records and
    promotional purposes. We will not publish your personal information or identifiable
    images of you without your consent. Video and records you send for the pregnancy
    guarantee are used to validate the claim and are handled as described in our Privacy
    Policy.
  </p>

  <h2>16. Governing law and disputes</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Nevada, USA, without regard to
    conflict-of-law rules. Before filing a claim, please contact us so we can try to
    resolve the issue informally within 30 days. Any dispute that cannot be resolved
    informally will be brought in the state or federal courts located in Clark County,
    Nevada, and you consent to their jurisdiction.
  </p>

  <h2>17. Changes to these Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version is posted on this
    page with its effective date. Changes apply to orders placed after the updated
    version is posted. If a change materially affects an order already paid, we will
    contact you when appropriate.
  </p>

  <h2>18. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these Terms can be sent to {LEGAL.businessName}, {LEGAL.location}, at
    <a href={LEGAL.phoneHref}>{LEGAL.phone}</a> or by
    <a href={LEGAL.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
